{
  "counter duelist": "反擊決鬥者",
  "Every dodge blade and counter is an Answer she saves for one heavy Tidal Ribbon. Whoever she dodges or counters grows Weary and slows down, the way the rival fish always wore itself out. One pick keeps Fighting Current open to counter everything, the other brings it back fast; the signature makes the first strike always miss.": "每次閃避飛刃與反擊都會累積回應，用來強化一次潮汐絲帶。被她躲開或反擊的敵人會疲憊減速。一種選擇延長鬥戰水流的反擊時機，另一種使它更快就緒。招牌天賦使首次符合條件的攻擊落空。",
  "line piercer": "貫穿戰線",
  "Her water Soaks every enemy it touches, and Soaked enemies take more of her magic and heal less. Tidal Ribbon sharpens on each enemy it cuts through, so long lines of enemies take the most. One pick breaks the first enemy on the line, the other the last; the signature runs the line to the edge of the field and back.": "水會浸濕敵人，使他們受到她更多魔法傷害，獲得的治療更少。潮汐絲帶每斬過一名敵人便更鋒利。一種選擇重創線上第一名敵人，另一種重創最後一名。招牌天賦讓斬擊延伸至戰場邊緣，再沿原路返回。",
  "storm showpiece": "風暴表演者",
  "Her basic attacks and dodges fill her hands with Water, and at full her next skill is Brimming. Thousand-Fin Tempest Dazzles every enemy it strikes three times; a deep pick holds the wave longer or breaks it all at once. The signature is the storm with no walls, across the whole field.": "普攻與閃避會累積水，集滿時下一個技能會滿溢。千鰭風暴會使被擊中三次的敵人目眩。進階天賦可以延長浪潮或讓浪潮一次破開。招牌天賦讓風暴覆蓋整個戰場。"
}
